0227 | \begin{remark}
0228 | There are Zumkeller numbers $a$ and $b$ that $b$ is the smallest Zumkellernumber which is greater than $a$ and $b-a=12$. For instance,
0229 | $a=222$ is a Zumkeller number. $b=224$ is the smallest Zumkeller number which is greater that $a$ and the difference between them is $12$.
